### Local secrets ###
# Per-machine configuration such as database credentials and the JWT signing
# secret. It lives next to pom.xml so that it is NOT packaged into the JAR, and
# it is never committed.
/application-local.properties
# Legacy location: kept ignored so an old copy can never be committed by accident.
src/main/resources/application-local.properties
